{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","roleHeading":"Case","externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"EidKit","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","role":"collection"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus/notSupported":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported","type":"topic"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Result of passive authentication — verifies that the data on the card was signed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Romanian state (MAI) and has not been tampered with."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"PassiveAuthStatus","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus"}}}